From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] script: shard the signature cache and add bounded TLS lookup

Partition SignatureCache into 16 cache-line-aligned shards with thread-local
fast lookup and add ParallelScriptWorkerPool.

Original-Commit: c7b441509eb0031241f3df411a09df74652ad12c
Original-Patch: ecash/018
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Candidate-Repair: Repair the incomplete cache boundary by moving its TLS/shard implementation from later27 to the header owner24 and adding explicit array/atomic includes and concurrent cache-instance-isolation regression. Keep24 one purpose: relocate original batch collector hooks, all original Schnorr batch assertions, and parallel block script dispatch into their complete legacy batch consumer27; preserve all source contributions and add its missing CMake source registration there. Existing sigcache plus concurrent cache tests pass manually; clean replay pending.
